label after_lampshade
operator: You're welcome, Gardener.
operator: Thank you, for seeing the things I can't.
operator: And hey!
operator: Between the two of us, what a view, right?
operator: Anyway, that lampshading out of the way now, let's talk about the items in this room.
operator: On one side, there's a mature version of that little plant of yours that reinvigorates your health.
operator: This big one packs a big punch, though --- going up to it and interacting will *permanently* increase your vitality.
operator: Just another thing Moonsanto was monopolizing, hey?
operator: The other side of the room has an upgrade to the Green Arsenal as a whole.
operator: It'll increase the magic flowing through the system enough to support two plants at the same time.
operator: So now you'll get to work with pairs of plants and further bring out their potential!
operator: Have fun and don't be afraid to experiment.
operator: Just having two plants out at once is enough to really increase the complexity of the options available to you.
operator: That said, would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
